filter.description:
Defect lookup filter. Supported `filter_type` values: TEST_RESULT, TEST_CASE, EXECUTION. Examples:
{"filter_type":"TEST_RESULT","test_result_ids":[1270298,1270299]}
{"filter_type":"TEST_CASE","test_case_ids":[101,102],"execution_id":2928609}
{"filter_type":"EXECUTION","execution_id":2928609}

oneOf.description:
Filter both sprints and releases by name using an object-based query.
Requires: type='All' and query with a 'where' expression.
Example: {"type": "All", "query": {"where": {"kind": "comparison", "field": "name", "op": "==", "value": "Q1"}}}

Find requirements by relative reference (no query needed).
Use this for: recent requirements, new requirements.
Requires: filter_type='RELATIVE' and scope.
Examples:
  {"filter_type": "RELATIVE", "scope": "RECENT"}
  {"filter_type": "RELATIVE", "scope": "NEW"}

filter.description:
Optional filter. Omit to return all requirements.

COMMON – filter by field value:
  {"filter_type": "COMMON", "query": {"where": {"kind": "comparison", "field": "<field>", "op": "==", "value": "<value>"}}}
  Supported fields: id, status, assignee, createdBy, externalIssue.summary

RELATIVE – time-based:
  {"filter_type": "RELATIVE", "scope": "RECENT"}  # recently updated
  {"filter_type": "RELATIVE", "scope": "NEW"}     # created in last 7 days

ITERATION – scoped to a sprint or release:
  {"filter_type": "ITERATION", "iteration_type": "SPRINT", "iteration_id": 123}
  {"filter_type": "ITERATION", "iteration_type": "RELEASE", "iteration_name": "Release 2026.04"}

oneOf.description:
Combine activity, assignment, lifecycle status and priority filters with AND.

At least one filter is required. Pass repository_id at the tool's top level.
Example: {"filter_type": "RELATIVE", "scope": "NEW", "assignment": "ASSIGNED_TO_ME"}

Find test results by field conditions using an RSQL query.
Requires: filter_type='COMMON'.
Example: {"filter_type": "COMMON", "query": {"where": {"kind": "comparison", "field": "status", "op": "==", "value": "FAILED"}}}

Find test results by relative reference (no query needed).
Use this for: recent test results, latest test result.
Requires: filter_type='RELATIVE' and scope.
Examples:
  {"filter_type": "RELATIVE", "scope": "RECENT"}
  {"filter_type": "RELATIVE", "scope": "LATEST"}

Fetch a single test result by its ID.
Requires: filter_type='TEST_RESULT' and test_result_id.
Examples:
  {"filter_type": "TEST_RESULT", "test_result_id": 123456}
  {"filter_type": "TEST_RESULT", "test_result_id": 123456, "include_details": true}

Fetch all test results of one execution, with job/environment info per row.
Requires: filter_type='EXECUTION' and execution_id.
Note: page_number/page_size paginate the execution's jobs for this filter.
Examples:
  {"filter_type": "EXECUTION", "execution_id": 2928609}
  {"filter_type": "EXECUTION", "execution_id": 2928609, "status": "FAILED"}

Find test suites by field conditions using an RSQL query or by name.
Requires: filter_type='COMMON'.
Example: {"filter_type": "COMMON", "query": {"where": {"kind": "comparison", "field": "testType", "op": "==", "value": "AUTOMATED"}}}

Combine activity and authorship filters with AND.

At least one filter is required. Pass repository_id at the tool's top level.
Example: {"filter_type": "RELATIVE", "scope": "NEW", "assignment": "CREATED_BY_ME"}

payload.description:
Object-based payload containing the dynamic app operation to perform. Each operation is discriminated by its 'action' field.

Example:
{
    "action": "CREATE",
    "app_name": "My Dynamic App",
    "pointer_app_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
}
{
    "action": "UPDATE",
    "app_id": "dynamic-app-123",
    "pointer_app_id": "new-target-789",
    "app_name": "Updated Dynamic App"
}

Object-based payload containing the test folder operation to perform. Each operation is discriminated by its 'action' field.

Example:
{
    "action": "CREATE",
    "path": "Test Cases/New Test Folder",
    "testFolderType": "TEST_CASE"
}
{
    "action": "RENAME",
    "id": 456,
    "name": "Renamed Test Folder"
}
{
    "action": "MOVE",
    "id": 456,
    "path": "Test Cases/Moved Test Folder"
}
{
    "action": "DUPLICATE",
    "id": 456
}
{
    "action": "DELETE",
    "id": 456
}

Object-based payload containing the test suite management operation. Discriminated by the 'action' field.
For CREATE and ADD_TEST_CASES with testCaseIds, every test case must have the same
test type as the suite. Mixed MANUAL/AUTOMATED cases are invalid.

Examples:
{
    "action": "CREATE",
    "name": "Smoke Tests",
    "path": "Test Suites/Regression",
    "testSuiteTestType": "MANUAL",
    "testCaseIds": [1, 2, 3]
}
{
    "action": "ADD_TEST_CASES",
    "id": 123,
    "testCaseIds": [456, 789]
}
{
    "action": "RENAME",
    "id": 123,
    "name": "New Test Suite Name"
}
{
    "action": "MOVE",
    "id": 123,
    "path": "Test Suites/Regression"
}
{
    "action": "DUPLICATE",
    "id": 123
}
{
    "action": "DELETE",
    "id": 123
}
